{
  "case": "prlic",
  "case_id": "IT-04-74",
  "date": "2007-04-18",
  "utterances": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "speaker": "JUDGE ANTONETTI",
      "role": "judge",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "[Interpretation] Could you please call the case, Mr. Registrar."
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "speaker": "THE REGISTRAR",
      "role": "registrar",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "Good afternoon, Your Honours. This is case number IT-04-74-T, the Prosecutor versus Prlic et al."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "speaker": "JUDGE ANTONETTI",
      "role": "judge",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "[Interpretation] Very well. On this Wednesday, 18th of April, 2007, I would like to welcome all the parties present, the Prosecution, the Defence teams, the accused, as well as anybody else assisting us in this court proceedings. And I would like to say that the interpreters worked longer hours yesterday, and I thank them for this. The Chamber will render two closed [as interpreted] session decisions, so I would like to register to go into closed session, please."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "speaker": "THE REGISTRAR",
      "role": "registrar",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "We are back in open session, Your Honours."
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "speaker": "JUDGE ANTONETTI",
      "role": "judge",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "[Interpretation] Very well. We are now in open session, and I would like to say that the hearing of today is continuing next week, actually. Mr. Scott, could you please tell us what is in store for next week? If you wish, we could also go into private session if that is necessary."
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "speaker": "MR. SCOTT",
      "role": "counsel",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "Yes, Your Honour, if we could go into private session, please."
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "speaker": "JUDGE ANTONETTI",
      "role": "judge",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "[Interpretation] Very well. Mr. Registrar."
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "speaker": "JUDGE ANTONETTI",
      "role": "judge",
      "type": "statement",
      "text": "to be reconvened on Tuesday, the 24th day of April, 2007, at 9.00 a.m. 23 24 25"
    }
  ],
